  <dart:DescriptionOfCommitments contextRef="CFY2026dHYA_ifrs-full_ConsolidatedAndSeparateFinancialStatementsAxis_ifrs-full_ConsolidatedMember_dart_TypesOfCommitmentsAxis_dart_PurchaseCommitmentMember_ifrs-full_CounterpartiesAxis_ifrs-full_IndividuallyInsignificantCounterpartiesMember" xml:lang="ko">당반기말 현재 연결실체가 자산 취득을 위해 약정한  금액은 280,626백만원입니다.</dart:DescriptionOfCommitments>
  <dart:DescriptionOfCommitments contextRef="CFY2026dHYA_ifrs-full_ConsolidatedAndSeparateFinancialStatementsAxis_ifrs-full_ConsolidatedMember_dart_TypesOfCommitmentsAxis_entity00105961_BrandAndLicenseCommitmentsMemberOfTypesOfCommitmentsDomainOfDisclosureOfOtherCommitmentsTableOfMember_ifrs-full_CounterpartiesAxis_entity00105961_LgCorpMemberOfCounterpartiesDomainOfDisclosureOfOtherCommitmentsTableOfMember" xml:lang="ko">연결실체는 ㈜LG와 상표권, 라이선스 계약을 체결하고 연결실체의 전 제품에 상표를 사용하고 있습니다.</dart:DescriptionOfCommitments>
  <dart:DescriptionOfCommitments contextRef="CFY2026dHYA_ifrs-full_ConsolidatedAndSeparateFinancialStatementsAxis_ifrs-full_ConsolidatedMember_dart_TypesOfCommitmentsAxis_entity00105961_InvestmentCommitmentsMemberOfTypesOfCommitmentsDomainOfDisclosureOfCommitmentsTableOfMember_ifrs-full_CounterpartiesAxis_entity00105961_YuantaMemberOfCounterpartiesDomainOfDisclosureOfOtherCommitmentsTableOfMember" xml:lang="ko">연결실체는 미래 성장분야의 신사업 기회 발굴을 위해 유안타 혁신 성장형 소부장펀드에 투자하고 있으며, 향후 405백만원의 추가 투자가 약정되어 있습니다.</dart:DescriptionOfCommitments>
  <dart:DescriptionOfCommitments contextRef="CFY2026dHYA_ifrs-full_ConsolidatedAndSeparateFinancialStatementsAxis_ifrs-full_ConsolidatedMember_dart_TypesOfCommitmentsAxis_ifrs-full_LoanCommitmentsMember_ifrs-full_BorrowingsByNameAxis_dart_GeneralLoanMember" xml:lang="ko">지배기업</dart:DescriptionOfCommitments>
  <dart:DescriptionOfCommitments contextRef="CFY2026dHYA_ifrs-full_ConsolidatedAndSeparateFinancialStatementsAxis_ifrs-full_ConsolidatedMember_dart_TypesOfCommitmentsAxis_ifrs-full_LoanCommitmentsMember_ifrs-full_BorrowingsByNameAxis_dart_OverdraftMember" xml:lang="ko">지배기업</dart:DescriptionOfCommitments>
  <dart:DescriptionOfCommitments contextRef="CFY2026dHYA_ifrs-full_ConsolidatedAndSeparateFinancialStatementsAxis_ifrs-full_ConsolidatedMember_dart_TypesOfCommitmentsAxis_ifrs-full_LoanCommitmentsMember_ifrs-full_BorrowingsByNameAxis_entity00105961_CashPoolingAgreementMemberOfTypesOfCommitmentsMemberOfDisclosureOfContingenciesTableOfMember" xml:lang="ko">연결실체 내 잉여ㆍ부족자금을 효율적으로 운용하기 위하여 Bank Mendes Gans와 공동현금약정(Notional cash pooling arrangement)을 체결하고 있습니다.</dart:DescriptionOfCommitments>
  <dart:DescriptionOfCommitments contextRef="CFY2026dHYA_ifrs-full_ConsolidatedAndSeparateFinancialStatementsAxis_ifrs-full_ConsolidatedMember_dart_TypesOfCommitmentsAxis_ifrs-full_LoanCommitmentsMember_ifrs-full_BorrowingsByNameAxis_entity00105961_TradeFinanceFacilityMemberOfBorrowingsByNameDomainOfDisclosureOfCommitmentsTableOfMember" xml:lang="ko">지배기업</dart:DescriptionOfCommitments>
  <dart:DescriptionOfCommitments contextRef="CFY2026dHYA_ifrs-full_ConsolidatedAndSeparateFinancialStatementsAxis_ifrs-full_ConsolidatedMember_dart_TypesOfCommitmentsAxis_ifrs-full_LoanCommitmentsMember_ifrs-full_BorrowingsByNameAxis_entity00105961_UmbrellaFacilityMemberOfBorrowingsByNameDomainOfDisclosureOfCommitmentsTableOfMember" xml:lang="ko">종속기업</dart:DescriptionOfCommitments>
  <dart:DescriptionOfCommitments contextRef="CFY2026dHYA_ifrs-full_ConsolidatedAndSeparateFinancialStatementsAxis_ifrs-full_ConsolidatedMember_dart_TypesOfCommitmentsAxis_ifrs-full_LoanCommitmentsMember_ifrs-full_BorrowingsByNameAxis_ifrs-full_FactoringOfReceivablesMember" xml:lang="ko">지배기업</dart:DescriptionOfCommitments>
  <dart:DescriptionOfCommitments contextRef="CFY2026dHYA_ifrs-full_ConsolidatedAndSeparateFinancialStatementsAxis_ifrs-full_SeparateMember_dart_TypesOfCommitmentsAxis_dart_PurchaseCommitmentMember_ifrs-full_CounterpartiesAxis_ifrs-full_IndividuallyInsignificantCounterpartiesMember" xml:lang="ko">보고기간말 현재 당사가 자산 취득을 위해 약정한 금액은 253,771백만원입니다.</dart:DescriptionOfCommitments>
  <dart:DescriptionOfCommitments contextRef="CFY2026dHYA_ifrs-full_ConsolidatedAndSeparateFinancialStatementsAxis_ifrs-full_SeparateMember_dart_TypesOfCommitmentsAxis_entity00105961_BrandAndLicenseCommitmentsMemberOfTypesOfCommitmentsDomainOfDisclosureOfOtherCommitmentsTableOfMember_ifrs-full_CounterpartiesAxis_entity00105961_LgCorpMemberOfCounterpartiesDomainOfDisclosureOfOtherCommitmentsTableOfMember" xml:lang="ko">당사는 ㈜LG와 상표권, 라이선스 계약을 체결하고 당사 및 종속기업의 전 제품에 상표를 사용하고 있습니다.</dart:DescriptionOfCommitments>
  <dart:DescriptionOfCommitments contextRef="CFY2026dHYA_ifrs-full_ConsolidatedAndSeparateFinancialStatementsAxis_ifrs-full_SeparateMember_dart_TypesOfCommitmentsAxis_entity00105961_InvestmentCommitmentsMemberOfTypesOfCommitmentsDomainOfDisclosureOfCommitmentsTableOfMember_ifrs-full_CounterpartiesAxis_entity00105961_YuantaMemberOfCounterpartiesDomainOfDisclosureOfOtherCommitmentsTableOfMember" xml:lang="ko">당사는 미래 성장분야의 신사업 기회 발굴을 위해 유안타 혁신 성장형 소부장펀드에 투자하고 있으며 향후 405백만원의 추가 투자가 약정되어 있습니다.</dart:DescriptionOfCommitments>
  <dart:DescriptionOfCommitments contextRef="CFY2026dHYA_ifrs-full_ConsolidatedAndSeparateFinancialStatementsAxis_ifrs-full_SeparateMember_dart_TypesOfCommitmentsAxis_ifrs-full_LoanCommitmentsMember_ifrs-full_BorrowingsByNameAxis_entity00105961_CashPoolingAgreementMemberOfTypesOfCommitmentsMemberOfDisclosureOfContingenciesTableOfMember" xml:lang="ko">당사는 전기까지 잉여ㆍ부족자금을 효율적으로 운용하기 위하여 종속기업(LGITIN, LGITPO, LGITMX, LGITUS)과 함께 Bank Mendes Gans와 공동현금약정(Notional cash pooling arrangement)을 체결하였으나, 당기 중 동 약정에서 제외되었습니다.</dart:DescriptionOfCommitments>
  <dart:DescriptionOfCommitments contextRef="PFY2025dHY_ifrs-full_ConsolidatedAndSeparateFinancialStatementsAxis_ifrs-full_ConsolidatedMember_dart_TypesOfCommitmentsAxis_ifrs-full_LoanCommitmentsMember_ifrs-full_BorrowingsByNameAxis_dart_GeneralLoanMember" xml:lang="ko">지배기업</dart:DescriptionOfCommitments>
  <dart:DescriptionOfCommitments contextRef="PFY2025dHY_ifrs-full_ConsolidatedAndSeparateFinancialStatementsAxis_ifrs-full_ConsolidatedMember_dart_TypesOfCommitmentsAxis_ifrs-full_LoanCommitmentsMember_ifrs-full_BorrowingsByNameAxis_dart_OverdraftMember" xml:lang="ko">지배기업</dart:DescriptionOfCommitments>
  <dart:DescriptionOfCommitments contextRef="PFY2025dHY_ifrs-full_ConsolidatedAndSeparateFinancialStatementsAxis_ifrs-full_ConsolidatedMember_dart_TypesOfCommitmentsAxis_ifrs-full_LoanCommitmentsMember_ifrs-full_BorrowingsByNameAxis_entity00105961_TradeFinanceFacilityMemberOfBorrowingsByNameDomainOfDisclosureOfCommitmentsTableOfMember" xml:lang="ko">지배기업</dart:DescriptionOfCommitments>
  <dart:DescriptionOfCommitments contextRef="PFY2025dHY_ifrs-full_ConsolidatedAndSeparateFinancialStatementsAxis_ifrs-full_ConsolidatedMember_dart_TypesOfCommitmentsAxis_ifrs-full_LoanCommitmentsMember_ifrs-full_BorrowingsByNameAxis_entity00105961_UmbrellaFacilityMemberOfBorrowingsByNameDomainOfDisclosureOfCommitmentsTableOfMember" xml:lang="ko">종속기업</dart:DescriptionOfCommitments>
  <dart:DescriptionOfCommitments contextRef="PFY2025dHY_ifrs-full_ConsolidatedAndSeparateFinancialStatementsAxis_ifrs-full_ConsolidatedMember_dart_TypesOfCommitmentsAxis_ifrs-full_LoanCommitmentsMember_ifrs-full_BorrowingsByNameAxis_ifrs-full_FactoringOfReceivablesMember" xml:lang="ko">지배기업</dart:DescriptionOfCommitments>
  <dart:DescriptionOfCommitments contextRef="PFY2025dHY_ifrs-full_ConsolidatedAndSeparateFinancialStatementsAxis_ifrs-full_SeparateMember_dart_TypesOfCommitmentsAxis_ifrs-full_LoanCommitmentsMember_ifrs-full_BorrowingsByNameAxis_entity00105961_CashPoolingAgreementMemberOfTypesOfCommitmentsMemberOfDisclosureOfContingenciesTableOfMember" xml:lang="ko">당사는 잉여ㆍ부족자금을 효율적으로 운용하기 위하여 종속기업(LGITIN, LGITPO, LGITMX, LGITUS)과 함께 Bank Mendes Gans와 공동현금약정(Notional cash pooling arrangement)을 체결하였습니다.</dart:DescriptionOfCommitments>
  <dart:DescriptionOfSensitivityAnalysisForEachTypeOfMarketRisk contextRef="CFY2026dHYA_ifrs-full_ConsolidatedAndSeparateFinancialStatementsAxis_ifrs-full_ConsolidatedMember_ifrs-full_TypesOfRisksAxis_ifrs-full_CurrencyRiskMember_ifrs-full_CurrencyInWhichInformationIsDisplayedAxis_dart_EURMember" xml:lang="ko">보고기간말 현재 다른 모든 변수가 일정하고 각 외화에 대한 기능통화의 환율이 10%변동시 환율변동이 세전이익에 미치는 영향은 다음과 같습니다.상기 민감도 분석은 보고기간말 현재 기능통화 이외의 외화로 인식된 주요 화폐성 자산 및 부채를 대상으로 하였습니다. 그러나 환율의 미래 변화는 판매가격과 매출총이익율에 추가적인 영향을 줄 수 있습니다.</dart:DescriptionOfSensitivityAnalysisForEachTypeOfMarketRisk>
