  <ifrs-full:DisclosureOfCompoundFinancialInstrumentsWithMultipleEmbeddedDerivativesExplanatory contextRef="CFY2026dHYA_ifrs-full_ConsolidatedAndSeparateFinancialStatementsAxis_ifrs-full_ConsolidatedMember_ifrs-full_ClassesOfFinancialLiabilitiesAxis_entity00105961_EmbededDerivativeLiabilitiesMemberOfClassesOfFinancialLiabilitiesDomainOfDisclosureOfFinancialLiabilitiesTableOfMember" xml:lang="ko">연결실체는 REC(신재생에너지 공급인증서)를 구매하는 계약을 체결하였으며, 구매계약 내 SMP(계통한계가격) 변동성을 주계약과 분리하여 내재파생상품으로 인식하였습니다.</ifrs-full:DisclosureOfCompoundFinancialInstrumentsWithMultipleEmbeddedDerivativesExplanatory>
